# Generated audio, and the catalogue naming it. A render is ~30 MB and the MP3
# encoded from it is ~2 MB; both come back from the generators beside them in
# public/assets/audio:
#   npm run audio
# Committing them would make the history ~300x larger than the source.
*.wav
*.mp3
public/assets/audio/index.json
.mixgain-*

